module «English preconditions»

total function «Steps»
  accepts remaining: nat, previous: number, current: number
  returns number
  requires «previous is non-negative» previous is at least 0
  requires «current is non-negative» current is at least 0
  ensures «the step is non-negative» result is at least 0
  example «No steps left»
    given remaining equals 0
    given previous equals 7
    given current equals 9
    expected 7
  if remaining is at most 0
    then previous
    else «Steps» of (remaining minus 1) and current and (previous plus current)
